From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] d3dx10_43, d3dx11_43: texture and image loading, shader file/resource entry points (3540)

d3dx10_43, d3dx11_43: texture and image loading, shader file/resource entry points

d3dx11_43 gets real D3DX11GetImageInfoFromMemory/File/Resource, D3DX11CreateTextureFromMemory/File/Resource and D3DX11CreateShaderResourceViewFromMemory/File/Resource (the Windows Imaging Component and DDS loader of d3dx10_43, on Direct3D 11 textures), D3DX11CompileFromResource and the D3DX11PreprocessShader entry points. d3dx10_43 gets D3DX10CompileFromFile/Resource, D3DX10PreprocessShaderFromFile/Resource and D3DX10CreateShaderResourceViewFromMemory/File/Resource (the preprocess entry points had one argument too few in the spec). Asynchronous loading through an ID3DX1xThreadPump is still not done (those calls say so and fail with E_NOTIMPL, as the existing d3dx11 texture loaders did).
---
--- a/dlls/d3dx10_43/compiler.c
+++ b/dlls/d3dx10_43/compiler.c
@@ -238,3 +238,226 @@
         *hresult = hr;
     return hr;
 }
